From: Xios Project <xios@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Avoid cross-type dependency comparison with modern Meson

Meson 0.60 and newer reject comparisons between pkg-config and internal
dependency objects. Identify the bundled libhandy dependency by its dependency
type instead.

--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -152,7 +152,7 @@ valadoc_dep_args = []
 foreach dep : valadoc_dependencies
   valadoc_dep_args += '--pkg'
-  if dep != libhandy
+  if dep.type_name() != 'internal'
     valadoc_dep_args += dep.name()
   else
     valadoc_dep_args += 'libhandy-1'
